The following were ported from MCP Memory Service 12.8.0 to TypeScript, with changes:

- the Cloudflare D1 schema (schema.sql)
- the content splitter and content hash (src/memory-record.function.ts)
- the memory type taxonomy (src/memory-record.function.ts)
- tag normalization (src/memory-record.function.ts)
- the memory_store, memory_search, memory_list, memory_delete and memory_update tool schemas
  and descriptions (src/tools.function.ts), and the reply text of those tools
  (src/search.function.ts, src/manage.function.ts)
- the search reply format and the response size limiter (src/search.function.ts)
